window.products.push({"id":113020,"name":"Ultra Durable WR02X11705 Refrigerator Filter Bypass Cap Replacement Part by Blue Stars - Exact Fit for GE Hotpoint Refrigerators - Replaces AP3425999 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tJ4Y-wMlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIFICATIONS This part is a replacement filter bypass cap for your refrigerator. If you intend to use an external water filtration system for your refrigerator, the bypass cap will allow you to do so. To use a filter bypass cap, simply screw it in where you would normally screw in the regular water filter. If you have a bypass system installed and your ice maker doesn’t make ice, your water dispenser doesn’t make water, or if there is water dripping inside your refrigerator, you may need to replace the bypass filter cap. This part is made of white plastic and is sold individually. Works with the following models: General Electric: BSS25GFPAWW, BSS25GFPACC, BSS25GFPCCC, BSS25GFPDCC, BSS25GFPCWW, BSS25GFPDWW, BSS25GFPECC, BSS25GFPEWW, BSS25GFPHCC, BSS25GFPHWW, BSS25JFRFWW, BSS25JFRJWW, BSS25JFTAWW, BSS25JFTBWW, BSS25JFTCWW, BSS25JFTDWW, BSS25JFTEWW, BSS25JFTGWW, BSS25JSTBSS, etc... Replaces part numbers: WR17X22070, AP3425999, 1038637, AH783756, EA783756, PS783756, WR02X10577, WR2X10577, LP24522 Works with most top name brands: General Electric, Hotpoint. Fix the following symptoms: Not dispensing water  Ice maker not making ice Leaking Count on our WR02X11705 Refrigerator Filter Bypass Cap Replacement part for an unrivaled mix of durability, convenient functionality, and great value for money. Save your time and money now! The GE brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the GE brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tJ4Y-wMlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueStars","source_asin":"B07YMX5J51","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YMX5J51","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YMX5J51","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":113021,"name":"Ravinte Silicone Stove Counter Gap Cover, Kitchen Stove Gap Cover Between Stove and Counter, Oven Side Gap Filler, Heat Resistant Stove Edge Guard to ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m0H1YpPmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔Spilling Preventing: If you are disturbed by the annoying problem that the kitchen foodstuff seeping into to gap between the stove or oven and the counter, you can choose this stove countertop gap filler, it can prevent food crumbs, juice, sauce, and other things from spilling or dripping the gap between countertop and stove. It also can be used as rectangle kitchen/office/house tools accessories. ✔Perfect Fit: Our gas stove slit strips are 2.2\" wide x 21\" long, it can cover and fit most stove gaps. The \"T\" shape insert design would insert into place to bridge the gap between stove and counter and will sit perfectly in place on all stoves, cooktops, ovens, appliances, furniture, and desktop. The same height can be better to place the slit filler. ✔Heat Resistant: Our silicone gap cover between the stove and counter is made of quality silicone material which is heat resistant and designed to withstand temperatures of up to 446F (230℃), will not warp from the heat, therefore you can use your stovetop in high heat settings without worries. But it is important to note that it's not fire resistant, please avoid direct contact with fire flame. ✔Dishwasher Safe - This food-grade silicone gap filler is allowing you to keep the gap clean.Safe in food environments. It can be safely used in dishwashers to wash and is easy to wipe clean with just water. The durable and reusable gap covers blend well into modern kitchens. Cookstove gap filler will help you save time on cleaning. It's also safe to use around pets and children. ✔Easily Customizable: The Black silicone stove counter gap cover is made of soft silicone material, which is flexible and customizable. The non-slip silicone is cuttable, you can cut the length with scissors, and allow you to customize its length as your need, to perfectly fit the countertop. The non-slip silicone will stay right where you placed, easy to lay flat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m0H1YpPmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ravinte","source_asin":"B0BB1NQRMH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB1NQRMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB1NQRMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
