window.products.push({"id":113028,"name":"W10196405 W10196406 Chrome Drip Pans and MP15YA MP21YA Electric Range Burner Element Unit Set by SupHomie - Compatible with Whirlpool Amana Electric R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712TdVd-2jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Drip bowls have a purpose beyond looking attractive. Drip bowls capture and reflect heat back to the coil which makes the burner work more efficiently. Drip bowls also catch spills that otherwise would drip down into the internal workings of the stove and can prevent electric shock to the user. Part Number: W10196406, W10196405 Color: Chrome Size: W10196406 6-Inch measures 7.5\" in diameter ; W10196405 8-Inch measures 9.4\" in diameter Replaces Part Numbers: W10196405 drip pans replaces WPW10196405, 10196405RW, AP6016814, AP11750107, PS11750107, etc. W10196406 drip pans replaces WPW10196406, W10196406RW, 1534547, AP6016815, PS11750108, EAP11750108, etc. Part Number: MP21YA, MP15YA Features: The turns are how many times the coil goes around in a circle. It has a \"Y\" style bracket. This burner fit most ranges except GE/Hotpoint. If the range burner does not sit flat on your stove, make sure the connection bolts are parallel and pushed a bit down.After installed and turn on the stove first time, the center piece protective coating will burn off and smoke, which is normal. Don’t worry about this. The heating element will work fine. Replaces Part Numbers: 6 Inch Surface Burner Element Replaces 5-50071, 4381748, AP6024130, PS11757480, EAP11757480,WPY04100165, Y707456, Y703422, Y0E00601299, MP15MA, MP12MA, etc. 8 Inch Surface Burner Element Replaces WPY04100166, 4381750, Y0E00801799, 400178, 19950009, 1938-344, 1938-249, 15928, 0E00801799, 04100166, SU306, MP26YA, MP26M, MP21U, MP21MA, Y04100166, AP6024131, PS11757481, EAP11757481, 1242502, PD00003012, etc. Package List: 3 x W10196406 Small Burner Drip Pan, 6 Inch 1 x W10196405 Large Burner Drip Pan, 8 Inch 3 x MP15YA 6\" (1500 watt 230v 4 turns burners) 1 x MP21YA 8\" (2100 watt 230 v 5 turns burners)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712TdVd-2jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SupHomie","source_asin":"B09TZQ7CLG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TZQ7CLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TZQ7CLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
