window.products.push({"id":113234,"name":"ZVac iRobot Roomba Replacement Parts - Compatible with i7, i7+, S9, S9+, E5, and E6 Vacuum Cleaner Series - 6-Pack HEPA Disposable Dust Bags with 3 Hi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XJCPs-mGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nothing feels better than coming back to a clean home. Just about any homeowner who owns a Roomba will sing its praises. The automatic vacuum saves them an enormous amount of time cleaning and does a more thorough job since it easily gets into smaller spaces. But as convenient as your Roomba might be, it’s still not something you can just set and forget. The bags have to be swapped out for new ones, and parts might need replacing. That’s where we come in. Get your vacuum back to work with these iRobot Roomba Replacement Parts by ZVac! With every purchase, you’ll receive six biodegradable dust bags, which are compatible with a wide range of Roomba models. Make disposing of your collected dirt easier with these bags! No annoying dust clouds and the high capacity means more time in between switching bags. One thing that many Roomba owners neglect is that filters need to be replaced on a regular basis; otherwise, the vacuum’s efficiency drops and it may even be damaged. Restore your Roomba to peak condition! The three high-performance filters in this package are designed to replace iRobot parts 4640235 and 4639161. Note: This is not an original iRobot product and is not covered under any iRobot warranty. Any mention of the iRobot or Roomba brand name, model or part designation in this listing is made solely for demonstrating compatibility. The best choice for Roomba owners: ✅ More than enough items in one set ✅ Keep your home free debris. ✅ Great savings and reliable quality Cleaning up doesn’t have to be hard or expensive. Add these ZVac iRobot Roomba Replacement Parts to your cart today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XJCPs-mGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZVac","source_asin":"B07V2B6TDH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V2B6TDH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V2B6TDH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
