window.products.push({"id":113249,"name":"HDX FMS-1 Replacement Water Filter / Purifier for Samsung Refrigerators (2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EBUkN9a7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This twin pack of refrigerator filters, compatible with most Samsung brands, is a welcome addition to any family looking to protect itself against harmful chemicals or particulates that may be present in the private or municipal water supply. The filtration system is composed of a carbon cylinder derived from organic coconut shell compounds. It is riddled with millions of micro-pores that keep hydrophobic particles like lead, zinc, asbestos, hydrogen sulfide, or chlorine out of your drinking water. It allows beneficial hydrophilic particles, those sometimes found in water like Calcium or Sodium, into your glass. Between the two of these filters, you can rest assured that your family will enjoy improved health for up to a year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EBUkN9a7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HDX","source_asin":"B00EFPY1VA","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EFPY1VA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EFPY1VA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":113250,"name":"Broan-NuTone Elite 27.6-inch Custom Power Pack Range Hood Insert for External Blower with 2-Speed Exhaust Fan and Light, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ws5b52e9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Upgrade your kitchen with the Broan-NuTone Elite 27.6-inch Custom Power Pack Range Hood Insert! This versatile range hood insert is designed to be paired with an external blower to offer a complete solution to your ventilation needs by providing both an exhaust fan and overhead light for your stove. This power pack insert is compatible with four exterior blower options in 600, 900, 1200, or 1500 CFM and four in-line blower options in 280, 600, 800, or 1100 CFM (sold separately) to equip your kitchen with smoke and odor-venting capability. The 2-speed slide control allows for quick fan adjustments and provides the ideal level of ventilation every time you cook, and the heat sentry detects excessive heat and adjusts blower speed automatically for convenience. The built-in lights accept up to 50-watt halogen bulbs to evenly illuminate your cooking area, and they are also controlled by slide switches for ease of use. This sleek stainless steel range hood insert fits neatly into range hood covers to provide a custom look and protect your cabinetry. The two one-piece dishwasher-safe aluminum filters with quick-release latches offer easy cleaning so you can maintain optimum grease capture and keep your kitchen ventilated. This convertible range hood unit measures 11.25\" x 27.5625\" x 3.25\" and is designed to fit 8\" round vertical ductwork for simple installation. It is both UL-Listed and HVI-2100 Certified for safety and protection, and it includes a 1 year limited warranty. Enhance your kitchen with the Broan-NuTone RMPE7004 Range Hood Power Pack! From the Manufacturer The Broan Elite Custom Power Pack is designed to fit flush with the bottom of a cabinet or custom hood that's 30 to 48-Inch wide. Your choice of external blower options allows you to choose the power and location you desire upon installation. Multi-speed slide control allows you to set just the right exhaust speed to keep up with whatever is cooking. Dual 50-watt Halogen lamps (GU10, MR16, 50-watt max included) provide brilliant lighting over the cook top and surrounding area. Dishwasher-safe aluminum filter features a quick-release latch and professional style appearance for good looks and a fresh kitchen. Select the proper blower - Choose from External blower options: fBroan exterior, 600, 900, 1200 or 1500 CFM, or four In-Line, 280, 600, 800, or 1100 CFM. (Blowers sold separately). Heat Sentry adjusts speed of blower to high automatically in case of excess heat, to prolong product life. Compatible with optional Broan Make-up Air Dampers (MD6TU or MD8TU, sold separately) to fit 6-Inch or 8-Inch ducting and help to balance the air pressure when the range hood is in use, keeping your environment comfortable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ws5b52e9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan-NuTone","source_asin":"B000ZIPN1S","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ZIPN1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ZIPN1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
