window.products.push({"id":113336,"name":"LA-1008 Dryer Rear Roller Shaft Kit Fits for Whirlpool Magic Chef Admiral Norge Dryer replaces 31001096 53-0197 PS2162268 LA-1008VP 53-0312N AP4242491","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Y1uDEbeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LA-1008 Dryer Rear Roller Shaft Kit Fits for Whirlpool Magic Chef Admiral Norge Dryer replaces 31001096 53-0197 PS2162268 LA-1008VP 53-0312N AP4242491 WP31001096 Product description: Before ordering this replacement part, please check for compatibility with your previous part and equipment model.  replacement part: part # LA-1008 replaces LA-1008VP, LA1008, AP4242491, 3044, 53-0312N, AH2162268, DE696, EA2162268, K35-251, PS2162268, B005BNMW3Y, B01MQ27826, 31001096, AP4038165, 2815, 53-0163, 53-0642, 53-1578, AH2030837, DE692, EA2030837, PS2030837. Repair symptoms and functions: It can repair symptoms such as bad bearings, drum bouncing up and down, won't tumble, won't start, abnormal noise, long drying time, etc. LA-1008 Dryer Rear Drum Roller Kit is used to allow the dryer to rotate and dry properly. Package Includes： Dryer Rear Drum Support Roller Kit: 2 x rear drum rollers,  2 x roller support shafts,  2 x fixing rings,  4 x spacers,  4 x screws. Installation: First you must remove the front panel of the dryer, from under the right side, slide the belt off the pulley, then pull out the drum and remove the lock ring and the wheel. Put in the new bracket and attach it to the wheel, washer and lock ring. Using pliers, push the lock ring onto the bracket and put the roller back in place, making sure it fits snugly between the wheel and the back of the dryer. Installation Notes: Use the following tools to install :Putty knife, 1/4” nut driver, flat head screwdriver, 5/16” nut driver, hammer.Unplug the dryer before installing this part. Wear work gloves to protect your hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Y1uDEbeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"savone","source_asin":"B09B1JTGCB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B1JTGCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B1JTGCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":113337,"name":"FS-TFC Ice Maker Installation Kit and Fridge Water Line Connection for Reverse Osmosis Systems, Refrigerator and Water Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xqYXQQyrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why choose the ice maker kit?1. This high-quality icemaker kit will provide you with clear and sparkling ice cubes and drinking water at your refrigerator by routing purified water from your existing reverse osmosis system. 2. The tested design allows users to connect and disconnect quick and easy without the need of any other tools. Applications include multiple potable liquids such as reverse osmosis drinking water, beverage dispensing, coffee machines, RV and Marine, misting systems, ice makers and many more. 3. If you have a reverse osmosis system and a refrigerator with an ice maker and/or water dispenser, this kit is perfect for you. A reverse osmosis filtration system hands down out performs a single inline carbon filter found in most popular refrigerators. So it's smart to connect RO with your refrigerator's water line. Parts List: -1/4 inch water tubing (25 ft. ) -a 1/4\" x 1/4\" x 1/4\" \"T\" valve -an inline 1/4\" x 1/4\" shut off valve -a compression fitting -a independent inline 1/4\" x 1/4\" valve 100% quality assurance. If you have any problems, please contact us, we'll reply to you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xqYXQQyrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FS-TFC","source_asin":"B074R9PRJY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074R9PRJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B074R9PRJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
