window.products.push({"id":113431,"name":"Bag Sealer, 16 Inches Metal Manual Impulse Sealer Heat Sealing Machine Bag Closer with 2 Free Replacement for Plastic Bags PE PP Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611uLlkVCoL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Features:Food and non-food applications, for both commercial and home use.Seal a wide range of bags and films with a maximum seal width of 40cm.8-grades adjustable thermal temperature control.Automatic power-off protection, the machine is plugged into the power supply, the default power-off state, when the operation is used, the sealing machine is powered on and heated to complete the sealing.It is small and portable and can seal various plastics with no warm-up time.Specification:Plug:US Plug 110V 60HzMaterial:Iron+ABS PlasticPulse Wattage:650WMaximum Seal Width:40cm/15.75inMaximum Seal Thickness:0.6mm/0.02inMaximum Sealing-in Width:3mm/0.12inHeating Time:0.2~2SPackage List:1*Pulse Sealing Machine2*Heat-resistant Bar2*Heating Wire1*Users ManualUsers Manual:Simply connect the power cord to the outlet and adjust the heating time based on the seal thickness of the material.Place the plastic bag on top, then press the handle, the LED indicator lights up and the machine will control the heating time itself.When the LED is off, the power is automatically disconnected. After 1-2 seconds, the handle is removed and the seal is completed.The Led indicator lights up only when the machine is sealed, and it does not illuminate if you just connect it to the outlet.If damage occurs during sealing, it is because the heating time is too long, then shorten the heating time by turning the timer knob counterclockwise.If an unsafe seal occurs, it is because the heating time is too short, then extend the heating time by turning the timer knob clockwiseIf the plastic bag is sticky to the machine, it is because the cooling time is not long enough.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611uLlkVCoL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPINCN","source_asin":"B08S3NY18G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S3NY18G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S3NY18G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
