window.products.push({"id":113478,"name":"Wildberries Replacement for Samsung HAF-CIN Water Filter Refrigerator DA29-00020A/B, rf4287hars water filter, DA97-08006A, 46-9101, RF28HMEDBSR, RF28H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QrRNC+FHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Frequently Asked Questions: Q: How often do I need to change my Wildberries refrigerator water filter? A: You need to change your refrigerator water filter every six months because: 1. It prevents water pressure to decrease from the dispenser, 2. It provides better smelling and tasting the water, 3. It helps in removing fine particles and sediments from water, 4. It prevents water contaminants from being reintroduced into your drinking water, 5. Drinking filtered water from your refrigerator can save you over hundreds of dollars a year instead of using bottled water. Q: Do these filters have an expiration date A: No. Our filters can sit on your shelf for as long as you need them. Please store in a cool, dark, and dry place like your kitchen cabinets. Q: How Tightly should I tighten the filter A: As long as you install them firmly by hand (not using tools) you will feel the filter hit the stop and know that it is properly installed. Most of the filters only require a quarter to a half turn to tighten. All of the filters will hit a stop when they are fully tightened. Q: What causes water to be cloudy after I installed my new fridge filter? A: The cloudiness is caused by microscopic air bubbles. Simply run three to four gallons of water through and the air bubbles will clear out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QrRNC+FHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wildberries","source_asin":"B07W4CLRQ6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W4CLRQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W4CLRQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
