window.products.push({"id":113831,"name":"Commercial Ice Maker Machine 120Lbs/24H with 35Lbs Ice Capacity, 45Pcs Clear Ice Cubes Ready in 11-20Mins, Stainless Steel Under Counter Freestanding ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":579.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710kMu2T6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【EFFICIENT ICE MAKING & LARGE STORAGE】- The professional commercial ice maker operates with an efficient powerful compressor for rapid ice making, which can quickly produce 45pcs of clear ice within 12-20mins one cycle and up to 120lbs of ice in 24h, it allows you to make about 350 drinks per day. A large storage capacity of 35lbs makes this ice maker perfect for your cocktail party, ensuring a surplus of ice for any occasion. 【EASY OPERATION & AUTO CLEAN】- A practical operation panel is attached to the ice machine featuring an LCD display, which possesses multiple functions, including self-cleaning, defrosting, reservation, malfunction reminders (indicators), etc. The ice-making time and ice thickness of the ice cubes can be adjusted by pressing the (+) or (-) buttons. (NOTE: Keep the ice machine upright for 24h before first use.) 【495W POWERFUL COMPRESSOR】- Due to the highly efficient CFC-free compressor, our ice cube-making machine is of lower noise, rapid cooling, and low power consumption. This undercounter ice maker machine adopts R290 refrigerant and air-cooled cooling, making ice production more energy-saving. Help you save money and avoid the demand of ice shortage. 【HEAVY-DUTY STAINLESS STEEL CONSTRUCTION】- The icemaker machine is built with heavy-duty stainless steel, featuring a food-grade PP liner, clean and sanitary. The integral thickened foam layer provides better insulation to prevent ice cubes from melting for 18-24 hours. The curved transparent PC cover facilitates easy fetching of ice and intuitive observation of the ice-making process. 【2 WATER INLET MODES】- The Freestanding Ice Maker Machine supports 2 ways to add water -- tap water and gallon bottled water, the premium water filter can turn tap water into pure water, which makes the ice cubes crystal clear and harder, cloudless, and chewable, can meet the needs of commercial ice machine and household ice maker. Great for home, restaurant, bar, hotel, etc. In addition, an ice scoop is available to facilitate ice fetching.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710kMu2T6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hothope","source_asin":"B0BS5M2GSB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-113831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS5M2GSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS5M2GSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
